  "description": "REPARTO CORSE TECHNOLOGIES Double butted 6061 aluminum for Gravel Monster, the perfect bike for having fun on different trails. New frame with integrated 1.5\" headset that makes the bike more rigid and allows for internal cable routing. Monocoque carbon fork with 1” ½ tapered steerer weighing 510g that absorbs vibrations, and front and rear thru axles that give the frame greater rigidity. Smooth Welding frame joints that make the finishes similar to carbon. Available with both Sram Apex and Shimano GRX400 and GRX600 groupsets at 20 and 22 speeds with optimized ratios. IDEAL FOR Designed to tackle any terrain in any season, without worrying about distances. Thanks to the superior quality components it guarantees excellent performance both in group rides and in races. PERFECT FOR YOU IF If you are looking for a reliable aluminum gravel bike with excellent handling capable of tackling rough roads with great riding comfort even on long journeys.",
